// expect: 134 trap: a precondition failed at tests/micros/mn-mod-open-says:7:13 — the divisor is 0
// A remainder's one fatal point is a zero divisor (INT_MIN % -1 is 0): the
// check at an open claim stops saying so at the operator's address, where
// the engine's own trap said `integer divide by zero`.
fn zero_from(n) = n - n

fn main() = 7 % zero_from(3)
